### =====================================================================
### Koleksi uji COA API - Sesi 3 (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Jalankan berurutan dari atas. Ganti @host bila port berbeda.
### Postman / Bruno: import docs/openapi.yaml
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:8080
@base = {{host}}/api/v1/accounts

### 1. Buat akun valid -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: skenario-1

{
  "code": "1101",
  "name": "Kas",
  "type": "ASSET",
  "parentCode": "1000"
}

> {%
    client.test("201 Created + Location", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 201, "status " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.headers.valueOf("Location") !== null, "Location kosong");
    });
    client.global.set("accountId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. Kode duplikat -> 409 Conflict
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "1101",
  "name": "Kas Kecil",
  "type": "ASSET"
}

> {%
    client.test("409 Conflict", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 409, "status " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.detail === "Kode akun 1101 sudah digunakan");
    });
%}

### 3. Payload tidak valid -> 400 + daftar error
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": ""
}

> {%
    client.test("400 + errors", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "status " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.errors.includes("code: must not be blank"));
    });
%}

### 4. Detail tidak ada -> 404 Not Found
GET {{base}}/9999

> {%
    client.test("404 Not Found", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "status " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.detail === "Akun 9999 tidak ditemukan");
    });
%}

### 5. Ubah nama akun -> 200 + data baru
PUT {{base}}/{{accountId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kas Besar",
  "type": "ASSET",
  "parentCode": "1000"
}

> {%
    client.test("200 + nama baru", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "status " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.name === "Kas Besar");
    });
%}

### 6. Nonaktifkan akun -> 204
PATCH {{base}}/{{accountId}}/deactivate

> {%
    client.test("204 No Content", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 204, "status " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 6b. Akun nonaktif tidak muncul di daftar aktif
GET {{base}}?page=0&size=100&sort=code,asc

> {%
    client.test("1101 tidak ada di daftar aktif", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "status " + response.status);
        client.assert(!response.body.content.some(a => a.code === "1101"));
    });
%}

### 6c. Detail tetap bisa dilihat dengan active=false
GET {{base}}/{{accountId}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Middleware (Step 7)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Endpoint ber-anotasi tanpa header -> 400 (controller tidak dipanggil)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/journals/1/post

### Dengan header -> lanjut ke controller (501: jurnal diimplementasikan di Sesi 4)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/journals/1/post
Idempotency-Key: post-1
X-Correlation-Id: abc-123
